; The aggregate phase names the manifest's dangling reference first: the value
; kind `bag` declares `:element missing`, so the preload walk reports it at
; [unk-elem-test bag element] before the document's element traversal reports
; the value at [set k].
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code unknown_element_kind :path [unk-elem-test bag element])
  (diagnostic :code unknown_element_kind :path [set k]))
